- Cultural formulation interview has not been conducted;  
- Formal assessment of reality testing (e.g., using standardized instruments) is not documented;  
- Neuropsychological screening has not been performed (though no cognitive symptoms are endorsed).

[DIAGNOSIS]  
Delusional disorder, grandiose type

